          "authors": "Virgil Andrei、Yu-Hsien Chiang、Motiar Rahaman 等",
          "paperTitle": "Modular perovskite-BiVO 4 artificial leaves towards syngas synthesis on a m 2 scale",
          "journal": "Energy &amp; Environmental Science (2025)",
          "published": "2025",
